%% PakVoice AI — Sequence: Login
sequenceDiagram
  actor Client
  participant UI as Next.js Login Page
  participant API as FastAPI /api/auth
  participant Store as JSON Store users.json
  participant JWT as Security JWT

  Client->>UI: Enter email, password, role
  UI->>API: POST /api/auth/login
  API->>Store: authenticate_user(email, password, role)
  alt Invalid credentials
    Store-->>API: null
    API-->>UI: 401 Unauthorized
    UI-->>Client: Show error
  else Valid user
    Store-->>API: User record
    API->>JWT: create_access_token(sub, email, role)
    JWT-->>API: access_token
    API-->>UI: TokenResponse + user
    UI->>UI: Persist token in authStore
    UI-->>Client: Redirect to Client or Admin portal
  end

  Note over Client,JWT: Optional path: GET /api/auth/google → Google OAuth → callback → JWT
